      "body": "## Overview\n\nReduce temporary allocations in offloading metrics collection, particularly during large batches of block lookups.\n\nNo matching optimization found in open-PR searches. AI assistance was used for implementation.\n\n## Claims\n\n- Create lookup and metric dictionaries only when missing.\n- Create histogram sample lists only on their first observation.\n- Preserve metric values, lookup deduplication, and reset behavior.\n\n## Validation\n\nExisting tests passed for this identical diff: 90 passed.\n\npython -m pytest \\\n  tests/v1/kv_offload/tiering/test_metrics.py \\\n  tests/v1/kv_connector/unit/offloading_connector/test_metrics.py \\\n  tests/v1/kv_offload/tiering/test_tiering_offloading.py \\\n  -q -p no:cacheprovider",
